    "Data read back wrong after %1$@: the drive holds about %2$@ of the %3$@ it reports (fake capacity, or failing memory)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ sonrasında veri yanlış okundu: disk bildirdiği %3$@ yerine yaklaşık %2$@ tutuyor (sahte kapasite ya da bozulan bellek)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Data the SSD could not read back correctly even with its error correction. Should be 0; any other value means data was lost and the NAND is failing." : {
